.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_SECTION_ADDR 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_section_addr
.Nd return the section virtual address field
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft uint64_t
.Fn elf_section_addr "const elf_section_t *section"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn elf_section_addr
function returns the section address field stored in
.Fa section
(the value corresponding to
.Dv sh_addr
in the ELF section header).
.Pp
For relocatable objects, this value is commonly zero until final layout or
linking assigns addresses.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The
.Fn elf_section_addr
function returns the section address.
It returns 0 if
.Fa section
is
.Dv NULL .
.Sh CAVEATS
A return value of 0 may represent either a null input or a legitimate section
address value.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_section_get 3 ,
.Xr elf_section_type 3 ,
.Xr elf_section 3
